WEBVTT

NOTE minimum-threshold: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

V0-1
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:06.614
Stop trivial adjustments reaching
Lynx. Set the percentage below

V0-2
00:00:06.714 --> 00:00:10.880
which a suggestion is either zeroed
or lifted to the threshold value.

V1a-1
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.948
The gear button at the
right of the toolbar,

V1a-2
00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.290
in its right-hand button group,
opens the settings dialog.

V1b-1
00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:23.613
It opens on Calculation, unless you have
used Review Threshold in the Push Changes

V1b-2
00:00:23.713 --> 00:00:28.006
dialog since the page loaded, in which
case it opens on Minimum Threshold.

V2a-1
00:00:35.056 --> 00:00:37.429
The left rail lists the settings groups.

V2a-2
00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:40.436
Minimum Threshold sits
second, under Calculation.

V2b-1
00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:43.780
The Settings dialog is now
on the Minimum Threshold tab.

V3a-1
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.683
Type the cutoff as a whole
number between 0 and 50.

V3a-2
00:00:53.783 --> 00:00:57.870
Setting the percentage to 0
disables the feature entirely.

V3b-1
00:00:58.373 --> 00:01:02.485
Here the threshold is set to 10
percent. The 0 to 50 bound is

V3b-2
00:01:02.585 --> 00:01:06.563
enforced by the dialog only.
There is no server-side check.

V4a-1
00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:17.021
Set to zero means Lynx receives 0 percent.

V4a-2
00:01:17.121 --> 00:01:21.532
Set to the minimum threshold
value raises the suggestion up to

V4a-3
00:01:21.632 --> 00:01:25.973
the threshold instead, so the
station still gets a small run.

V4b-1
00:01:26.483 --> 00:01:30.014
Exclude Zeros, available
only on the second option,

V4b-2
00:01:30.114 --> 00:01:33.853
leaves genuine zeros at zero
rather than lifting them.

V5a-1
00:01:40.386 --> 00:01:45.554
Save Changes saves the edits on every tab
of Settings together. A threshold-only

V5a-2
00:01:45.654 --> 00:01:51.016
change does not reload the dashboard; the
pending push list is simply recalculated.

V5b-1
00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:56.448
Open Push Changes and the pink banner
tells you how many stations the threshold

V5b-2
00:01:56.548 --> 00:02:00.730
touched, with each affected row showing
its original value and the adjusted one.
